{"seq":4,"slug":"public-opinion-communication","title":"舆论与公共传播","stage":"DONE","category":"media-communication","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/public-opinion-communication","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.21,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 舆论与公共传播：意见如何形成与流动\n\n## 定位与边界\n\n舆论与公共传播探讨公众意见如何形成、传播和演变，以及组织和机构如何在公共空间中进行有效沟通。本 hub 的独特焦点在于\"意见的社会动力学\"——公众的态度和观点如何在社会互动中形成、聚合、极化和转变，以及如何有意识地影响这一过程。与媒体传播类目下的兄弟 hub 相比：「传播学理论」提供传播学的一般性理论框架；「媒介生态」讨论媒介本身如何塑造信息环境；「数字媒体与平台经济」聚焦数字平台的商业逻辑；「广告与品牌传播」中虽也涉及说服但目标是商业性的——本 hub 关注的是更广泛的公共话语场域中的意见竞争。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n本 hub 共三章，从理论基础到实务策略逐层推进：\n\n**第一章 舆论学基础**——讲解舆论形成的基本理论框架：舆论的定义与构成、沉默的螺旋与意见气候、意见领袖的中介作用、公共领域理论。理解公众意见从个体认知到集体共识的演化过程。\n\n**第二章 危机传播**——聚焦组织在突发事件中的信息传播策略：危机传播的经典理论模型、危机应对的阶段性策略、声誉修复与管理的系统方法。\n\n**第三章 宣传与说服**——深入分析信息传播中的劝服机制：宣传技术的历史演变、说服理论的心理学基础（精细加工可能性模型等）、信息战在数字时代的新形态。\n\n建议先从第一章建立舆论形成的理论认知，再学习第二章掌握危机传播的实战策略，最后通过第三章理解公共传播中说服与反说服的完整图景。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n无需传播学专业背景。建议对以下概念有基本了解：大众媒体的基本类型、社交媒体的基本特征、信息传播的发送者-渠道-接收者基本模型。如对这些概念陌生，可先浏览「传播学理论」hub 的第一章。\n\n## 延伸阅读\n\n- [传播学理论](../1_communication-theory/)——传播学的一般性理论框架与核心模型\n- [数字媒体与平台经济](../3_digital-media-platform-economy/)——数字平台如何重塑舆论传播的基础设施\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"public-opinion","title":"舆论学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/public-opinion-communication/public-opinion","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"opinion-formation","title":"舆论形成机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/public-opinion-communication/public-opinion/opinion-formation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"opinion-leaders","title":"意见领袖与二级传播流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/public-opinion-communication/public-opinion/opinion-leaders"},{"seq":3,"slug":"public-sphere","title":"公共领域理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/public-opinion-communication/public-opinion/public-sphere"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"crisis-communication","title":"危机传播","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/public-opinion-communication/crisis-communication","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crisis-theory","title":"危机传播理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/public-opinion-communication/crisis-communication/crisis-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"crisis-response","title":"危机应对策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/public-opinion-communication/crisis-communication/crisis-response"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reputation-management","title":"声誉管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/public-opinion-communication/crisis-communication/reputation-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"propaganda-persuasion","title":"宣传与说服","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/public-opinion-communication/propaganda-persuasion","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"propaganda-techniques","title":"宣传技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/public-opinion-communication/propaganda-persuasion/propaganda-techniques"},{"seq":2,"slug":"persuasion-theory","title":"说服理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/public-opinion-communication/propaganda-persuasion/persuasion-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"information-warfare","title":"信息战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/public-opinion-communication/propaganda-persuasion/information-warfare"}]}]}